  "question": {
    "text": "Extraction for zinc from zinc blende is achieved by",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "YY1wT",
      "text": "\nelectrolytic reduction\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ahmw3",
      "text": "\nroasting followed by reduction with carbon\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "MiSAU",
      "text": "\nroasting followed by reduction with another metal\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "4uSze",
      "text": "\nroasting followed by self-reduction",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Zinc blende is roasted and then treated with coke for the reduction.\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\n2 \\mathrm{ZnS}+3 \\mathrm{O}_2 \\stackrel{\\Delta}{\\longrightarrow} 2 \\mathrm{ZnO}+2 \\mathrm{SO}_2 \\uparrow \\\\\n\\mathrm{ZnO}+\\mathrm{C} \\stackrel{\\Delta}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathrm{Zn}+\\mathrm{CO} \\uparrow\n\\end{gathered}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
